    "sections": {
        "description": "Modern House is a clean, modern, and performance-optimized WordPress theme designed for a variety of contemporary websites including interior design studios, architecture firms, real estate agencies, furniture showrooms, home renovation services, lifestyle brands, and small businesses. Built with speed, SEO, and Core Web Vitals in mind, it delivers a smooth and responsive experience across all devices. Fully compatible with Gutenberg, Elementor, Bricks, Oxygen, and WooCommerce, Modern House gives you complete control over layout, styling, and content creation. With RTL and translation-ready support, flexible customization options, and seamless integration with popular plugins, it’s the ideal choice for building elegant, professional, and high-converting websites. Explore the sleek functionality and timeless design of Modern House today at https://wpfrank.com/demo/modern-house-pro/"
    },
